171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (Six tables were created with primary keys,foreign keys, NOT NULL and CHECK constraints. Prices and quantities must be positive \(stock may be 0 but never negative\), gender is limited to 'M' or 'F', each employee belongs to one branch, and each invoice has exactly one employee and one customer. InvoiceDetail uses a composite primary key \(invoiceNo, itemNo\). An AuditLog table and three sequences were also created. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
