<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (Two roles \(Manager andEmployee\) and two users \(POS_Manager and POS_Employee\) were created.Each user received only the role that matches his job. The Manager role has full access \(SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE,DELETE\) to all six tables. The Employee role can only SELECT from Customer and Items and INSERT into Invoice and InvoiceDetail. Both roles can execute POS_PKG, which runs with its owner's rights so an employee can use it without direct UPDATE rights. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
